WEBVTT

00:08:29.922 --> 00:08:32.800
beginning with our first scientific
observations this summer.

00:08:32.841 --> 00:08:34.009
So please stay tuned.

00:08:34.051 --> 00:08:36.220
Astronomers travel with the speed of light

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:38.180
and the speed of imagination.

00:08:39.348 --> 00:08:43.978
(Applause)